        "original_id": "70134a98-04e4-5d66-ba2e-9afe293d10e3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Matt Groening, Al Jean, Mike Reiss, Sam Simon, Rich Moore, Hank Azaria\n- Works: \"The Telltale Head\", \"Eight Misbehavin'\"\n- Characters: Apu Nahasapeemapetilon, Manjula\n- Topics: voice acting, episode writing and directing, octuplets, fertility drugs\n\nFacts:\n- Matt Groening was born on February 15, 1954, and he is an American cartoonist, writer, producer, animator, and voice actor.\n- The episode \"The Telltale Head\" was written by Al Jean, Mike Reiss, Sam Simon, and Matt Groening, and it was directed by Rich Moore.\n- Apu Nahasapeemapetilon first appeared in the episode \"The Telltale Head\".\n- Hank Azaria voices Apu Nahasapeemapetilon.\n- In the episode \"Eight Misbehavin'\", Manjula gives birth to octuplets as a result of fertility drugs.\n- In \"Eight Misbehavin'\", Manjula and Apu unintentionally allow a zookeeper to exploit their babies in exchange for help after corporate sponsors abandon them for a mother who gave birth to nonuplets.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
